{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ultimate card and strategy roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Deal Card is an addictive card roguelike</strong>. Combine cards on a 3x3 board, use special cards to unleash explosive synergies that completely transform each run. Unlock unique decks, acquire cards for your build, buy passive upgrades, and improve your economy with minigames that add variety \u2014 every run becomes a unique experience.<br> Will you keep calm and plan your next move, or give in to the addictive pull of the board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.poster.avif?t=1759054568\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.webm?t=1759054568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/6490cbd2be19f32aec5e181ac327dca4.mp4?t=1759054568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every game, a new strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: start with a unique deck, discover special cards, and choose passive upgrades that will change your playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 Special Cards</strong> that transform your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Passive Upgrades</strong> that boost XP, coins, discounts, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Different Decks</strong> with unique pros and cons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Levels</strong> with special rules that will test your ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between levels... every decision matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your coins in the shop, take risks in games of chance, or buy new cards to take your run further.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Card Shop:</strong> unlock devastating synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Packs:</strong> expand your deck with surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of Chance:</strong> Roulette, Blackjack, Twin Cards, Hi-Lo, and Slots.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/25a797c38380d48921f638d1311e6018.poster.avif?t=1759054568\" width=168 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/25a797c38380d48921f638d1311e6018.webm?t=1759054568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete and progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks to unlock more cards, decks, and perks. Looking for even more adrenaline? Enter Competitive Mode and climb the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why you'll love it</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, impossible to master:</strong> clear mechanics with a deep strategic layer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite synergies:</strong> every run brings new combos and ways to break the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Roguelike:</strong> addictive progression and card strategy in one game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luck + Skill:</strong> whether you're a planner or a risky player, there's a playstyle for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fortune favors the bold\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play your best hand? <strong>Add Mega Deal Card to your Wishlist</strong> and bet on the ultimate challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854730?t=1759054568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854730?t=1759054568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/7f32183d563a2bd75f6fdda5a65c560d42a6ea42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759054568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/7f32183d563a2bd75f6fdda5a65c560d42a6ea42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759054568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ultimate card and strategy roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Deal Card is an addictive card roguelike</strong>. Combine cards on a 3x3 board, use special cards to unleash explosive synergies that completely transform each run. Unlock unique decks, acquire cards for your build, buy passive upgrades, and improve your economy with minigames that add variety \u2014 every run becomes a 